      "content": "Your feelings of existential emptiness are a common human experience that has been studied for centuries, showing that the struggle to find meaning is part of what makes us feel alive. Even if the universe appears cold, many philosophers suggest that creating our own purpose transforms these raw experiences into something surprisingly profound and interconnected. Sometimes, simply acknowledging this void can be the first step toward finding a new kind of meaning that isn't dependent on external approval. It is a heavy place to stay, but recognizing the shadows often leaves space for the unique, unrepeatable light of your own life.",
