      "content": "i get what you mean about \"letting go of the weight,\" but it feels like more than just letting go of expectations. it feels like the struggle itself is just a burden i don't want to carry anymore. if the universe is just random noise and everything ends in nothing, then why is there this constant pressure to keep enduring? why is it considered \"wrong\" to just want to step out of the cycle when it's clearly all going nowhere anyway? it feels like the most logical conclusion to the void is just... leaving it.",
